# 📖 Executive Summary

This repository demonstrates the implementation of a production-inspired retail analytics platform that transforms raw transactional data into executive-ready business intelligence dashboards.

Unlike traditional portfolio projects that directly connect CSV files to Power BI, this solution follows a layered enterprise analytics architecture where raw datasets are extracted, validated, transformed, modeled, optimized, and finally visualized using interactive dashboards.

The project combines multiple disciplines of modern analytics into one integrated solution:

- Data Engineering
- Data Warehousing
- Advanced SQL Development
- Forecast Analytics
- Business Intelligence
- Executive Reporting

The objective was not only to build dashboards but to simulate how enterprise organizations prepare data before it reaches decision-makers.

---

# 🎯 Business Problem

Modern retail organizations generate millions of transactional records every month across customers, products, markets, regions, and distribution channels.

Although large volumes of data are available, raw transactional datasets cannot directly answer important business questions because they lack:

- Business-ready data models
- Pricing information
- Manufacturing costs
- Freight expenses
- Invoice deductions
- Forecast datasets
- Profitability calculations
- Executive KPIs

Without a structured analytical platform, decision-makers struggle to identify revenue opportunities, forecast demand, monitor profitability, and optimize operations.

---

# 🎯 Solution Overview

To address these challenges, a complete enterprise-style analytics solution was designed that integrates Data Engineering, SQL Development, Data Warehousing, Forecast Analytics, and Business Intelligence into one scalable workflow.

The project performs the complete analytical lifecycle including:

- Automated Python ETL
- Relational Database Design
- SQL-Based Data Cleaning
- NULL Value Handling
- Data Validation
- Business Rule Implementation
- Star Schema Modeling
- Advanced SQL Analytics
- Forecast Validation
- Interactive Power BI Dashboards
- Executive KPI Reporting

