# ▶️ SQL Script Execution Order

Execute SQL scripts in the following sequence to recreate the complete analytics platform.

```text
Database Setup
        ↓
Table Creation
        ↓
Dimension Tables
        ↓
Fact Tables
        ↓
Data Cleaning
        ↓
Views
        ↓
Functions
        ↓
Stored Procedures
        ↓
Window Functions
        ↓
Data Validation
        ↓
Data Profiling
        ↓
Forecast Validation
        ↓
Indexes
        ↓
Triggers
        ↓
Events
        ↓
Business Analysis Queries
        ↓
Query Optimization
```

